 "measureEffective": "2026-12-06",
 "measureEffectiveNote": "No statewide measures are on the Nov 3, 2026 Texas ballot (the Legislature proposes amendments in odd years; the Legislative Reference Library lists no 2026 amendment election). Rule for reference: a legislatively proposed constitutional amendment takes effect when the official statewide canvass shows majority approval, unless the amendment states a later date (Tex. Const. art. XVII, sec. 1). The governor's state canvass for this election falls within the window set by Election Code sec. 67.012 (18th-33rd day after election day for the general election); 2026-12-06 is the latest day of that window and is notional only.",
